<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>SKINNY</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Billie Eilish</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">HIT ME HARD AND SOFT</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1CsMKhwEmNnmvHUuO5nryA</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.689" end="00:19.281">Fell in love for the first time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.281" end="00:22.739">With a friend, it's a good sign</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.739" end="00:26.366">Feelin' off when I feel fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.366" end="00:29.133">Twenty-one took a lifetime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.133" end="00:30.633" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.850" end="00:33.383">People say I look happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.383" end="00:36.931">Just because I got skinny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.931" end="00:40.772">But the old me is still me and maybe the real me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.772" end="00:44.090">And I think she's pretty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.090" end="00:47.870" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.870" end="00:55.870">And I still cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.852" end="01:04.852">Cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.882" end="01:11.958">And you know why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.958" end="01:13.458" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.524" end="01:15.801">Am I acting my age now?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.801" end="01:19.499">Am I already on the way out?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.499" end="01:23.248">When I step off the stage, I'm a bird in a cage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.248" end="01:25.964">I'm a dog in a dog pound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.964" end="01:27.464" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.527" end="01:30.026">And you said I was your secret</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.026" end="01:33.525">And you didn't get to keep it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.525" end="01:37.226">And the internet is hungry for the meanest kind of funny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.226" end="01:40.239">And somebody's gotta feed it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.239" end="01:44.651" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.651" end="01:52.651">Do you still cry?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.671" end="02:00.671">Still cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.187" end="02:06.626">Cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.626" end="02:08.126" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.943" end="02:10.361">I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.361" end="02:13.758">Never did you wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.758" end="02:17.365">And my</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.365" end="02:20.742">My patience is gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.742" end="02:24.320">And I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.320" end="02:28.106">I never did you wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.106" end="02:31.424">I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.424" end="02:35.424">I loved you for so long</p></div></body></tt>